@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Kiem tra trang thai may chu -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Lay danh sach bai tap -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 3. Nop bai hop le -> 201 Created + Location
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 1,
  "studentCode": "DTC245200019",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/Qtruong26/EduSubmit-DTC245200019"
}

### 4. Nop bai thieu thong tin (ma SV trong) -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 1,
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/Qtruong26/EduSubmit-DTC245200019"
}

### 5. Nop bai sai assignmentId (<= 0) -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 0,
  "studentCode": "DTC245200019",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/Qtruong26/EduSubmit-DTC245200019"
}

### 6. Doc lai bai nop theo ID khong ton tai (Bai mo rong) -> 404 Not Found
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
